{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/100132","id":2221143498,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6EY_XK","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100132","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100132.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100132.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100132","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/100132/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/100132/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100132/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/a3f48f70473194ce5d04537a18ef06a63094d798","number":100132,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Optimize String construction from statically known strings by evaluating `strlen` at compile-time.","user":{"login":"Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce","html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"In this PR, `String` constructors are now available which make use of known string lengths, avoiding a `strlen` call. For example, when using string literals like `String s = \"Test\"` it is knowable at compile-time that `\"Test\"` is a 4-length string. This is used to speed up `String` construction.\r\n\r\nThis PR builds on #99816. There, I have tested `String` construction from a long shader string literal, taken from the codebase. I ran [the same benchmark](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99816#issuecomment-2514703257) to see how much known-length construction speeds up allocation:\r\n\r\n- `335us` on master (https://github.com/godotengine/godot/commit/aa8d9b83f66488dbb2c9c918e9016ef80f821fb4)\r\n- `139us` on [#99816](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99816) (https://github.com/godotengine/godot/commit/e1c42392c20d53066f861c6f9f29dce8d1ac4729)\r\n- `100us` on this branch (10aac990e158592e2ed50b9dbeb513c7505128e2)\r\n\r\nThe speed-up is likely to be slightly better for short strings.","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097966,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc5NjY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:core","name":"topic:core","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":3240950060,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzMjQwOTUwMDYw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/performance","name":"performance","description":"","color":"447777","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":10558797,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AoR1N","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/20","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/20","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/20/labels","number":